WEBVTT

00:09:59.704 --> 00:10:02.704
that are now housed
at the Air and Space Museum

00:10:02.746 --> 00:10:04.537
at the Smithsonian.

00:10:04.537 --> 00:10:05.996
He sits me down.

00:10:06.371 --> 00:10:09.037
He says, "Do you know
of the Golden Thirteen?"

00:10:09.079 --> 00:10:13.079
I said, "No, Colonel Thompson,
I've never heard of the Golden Thirteen."

00:10:13.454 --> 00:10:17.287
He said, "They were the Navy's version
of the Tuskegee Airmen

00:10:17.329 --> 00:10:20.246
and there are four left
living in the country,

00:10:20.287 --> 00:10:22.079
and one lives upstairs.

00:10:22.454 --> 00:10:24.829
And he'd like to talk to you also."

00:10:25.287 --> 00:10:29.662
It was at that moment that I knew

00:10:29.662 --> 00:10:32.787
that we were on a path of great discovery.